## Soccer — PL, La Liga, Serie A, Bundesliga, Ligue 1, MLS

| | |
|--|--|
| Kind | `soccer` |
| Fixtures | `match_context` / league fixtures (FotMob-style upcoming) |
| Markets | Result, Safer Result, DNB, handicap, BTTS, goals, corners |
| Picks | Safer Result only where later-slice eval cleared 70% |
| Settle | `_lookup_soccer` ← football-data **history** (`FTHG`/`FTAG`, corners if present) |
| Results | League results / backtest pages from the same history |

**Caveat:** soccer settle lags until football-data updates (often next day). Live scoreboard is not wired for combo settle yet.

