## Baseball — MLB

| | |
|--|--|
| Kind | `mlb` · tz America/New_York |
| Fixtures / settle | ESPN scoreboard `site.api` / web API (`mlb_fixtures.get_fixtures`) |
| Markets | Moneyline skipped on public Today's Picks (coin-flip ~55%). Totals, team runs, hits, Ks; Upset lean if close |
| Results | `/mlb/results` from ESPN + Elo refresh every 3h (`degen-refresh-data`) |

Prefer completed same-date game in a series.

---

## Baseball — NPB

| | |
|--|--|
| Kind | `npb` · tz Asia/Tokyo |
| Fixtures | spaia `schedules` (times/teams) |
| **Finals** | spaia `games_info_by_date` (`homeTeamTotalRuns` / `gameStateId` 4). Season `schedules` **lags hours** on `HScore`/`GameState` — do not settle from that alone |
| Markets | Same coin-flip moneyline skip as MLB; totals / team runs / Upset lean |
| Results | `/npb/fixtures` shows live overlay; combo settle uses `completed` after overlay |

Match home/away + kickoff date (same pairing plays several days).

