## Cricket — The Hundred

| | |
|--|--|
| Kind | `cricket` · `hundred` · tz Europe/London |
| Fixtures | Wikipedia `{{Single-innings cricket match}}` (`hundred_fixtures`) |
| Names | MI London → Oval Invincibles; Sunrisers Leeds → Northern Superchargers; Manchester Super Giants → Originals |
| Picks | Match winner skipped on public board (coin-flip). Totals / team runs / Upset lean |
| Settle | `_lookup_cricket` ← **full** `get_hundred_fixtures()` (not upcoming-only) |
| Results | `/hundred/results` = Wikipedia completed **merged** onto Cricsheet. Archive alone stops days behind |

