## Cricket — IPL / BBL

| | |
|--|--|
| Fixtures / settle | fixturedownload.com (`cricket_fd_fixtures.get_competition_fixtures`) |
| Results | Cricsheet `/ipl/results` `/bbl/results` (fd feed also has completed flags) |
