## Tennis — ATP men only

| | |
|--|--|
| League | `atp` — **one** sport `/sports/tennis`. Surface = filter/feature, not a league |
| Scope | GS / Masters / 500 / 250 **singles** only. Skip qualifying on the public fixture board; skip doubles / WTA |
| Fixtures | ESPN `site.web.api.espn.com` (not `site.api` — 403 from cloud) + Wikipedia brackets |
| Markets | Match winner, total sets (2.5/3.5), player to win a set, total games, handicap (±3.5 / ±5.5) |
| Settle | `_lookup_tennis`: prefer **completed** within ±1 day of kickoff; never grade today’s pairing with a week-old rematch |
| Score | `tennis_score.parse_tennis_score` (winner-first set string) |

---

## Not sports (same site)

- **Stocks / crypto:** ranking boards, not combo legs. Show **relative** lean (vs board / Beat BTC). Do not paint every absolute equity-premium forecast as a buy.
- Crypto: range-only when absolute USD direction fails OOS. No 5y–25y public chips.

---

## After-event automation

`degen-post-event.timer` → bust caches (hundred/cpl/tennis/npb/mlb) → `settle_pending` → `data/feedback/post_event.json`.

Install: `bash deploy/setup_automation.sh`
